T* () Tj
T* (**Problem:**  ) Tj
T* (In semi-arid rural Kenya \(Nakuru, Baringo, Kitui\), smallholder beekeepers lose o) Tj
T* (ver 40% of their potential harvest due to unmonitored hive swarming, predator at) Tj
T* (tacks, and reliance on traditional hollow-log hives \(yielding only 8 10 kg of im) Tj
T* (pure honey per year\). At the same time, post-consumer plastic waste clogs local ) Tj
T* (municipal ecosystems, and beekeepers are exploited by informal middlemen paying ) Tj
T* (below-market prices.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (**Solution:**  ) Tj
T* (**EcoHive Kenya Ltd.** engineers climate-smart Langstroth beehives manufactured ) Tj
T* (from 100% recycled high-density polyethylene \(HDPE\) plastic waste, equipped with) Tj
T* ( solar-powered IoT telemetry sensors \(measuring temperature, brood acoustic freq) Tj
T* (uency, and colony weight\). The web platform unites:) Tj
T* (1. An interactive, procedural 3D hive explorer with layer explosion and real-tim) Tj
T* (e raycasting inspection.) Tj
T* (2. A fluid WebGL Amber honey shader hero responding to live cursor physics.) Tj
T* (3. A real-time IoT apiary telemetry dashboard monitoring hive health.) Tj
T* (4. **Hive AI**, a context-grounded conversational agent powered by Google Gemini) Tj
T* ( \(with role personas for farmers, impact investors, and honey buyers\).) Tj
T* (5. A transparent 35% above spot-market cash off-take commercial model.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (**Audience:**  ) Tj
T* (Smallholder Kenyan beekeepers, impact & ESG investors, organic honey commercial ) Tj
T* (off-takers, and climate technology researchers.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (**Why this project?**  ) Tj
T* (It demonstrates how advanced frontend engineering \(custom WebGL GLSL shaders, pr) Tj
T* (ocedural Three.js 3D rendering, and resilient multi-tier LLM integration\) can di) Tj
T* (rectly solve an ecological and economic development challenge in East Africa wit) Tj
T* (hout sacrificing performance, accessibility, or production hygiene.) Tj
ET
