/F1 9 Tf
T* (The most difficult engineering challenge was balancing **rich visual interactivi) Tj
T* (ty against rural connectivity constraints**. ) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Initially, the 3D smart hive could have been implemented by downloading a pre-pa) Tj
T* (ckaged 25MB `.glb` 3D model. However, testing on simulated 3G network conditions) Tj
T* ( \(representative of Baringo and Kitui counties\) resulted in unacceptably long lo) Tj
T* (ading times and dropped frames on lower-end Android devices. ) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (To solve this, I rejected heavy asset files completely and engineered the entire) Tj
T* ( Langstroth hive **procedurally using Three.js primitive geometries, custom canv) Tj
T* (as wood textures, and mathematical mesh layering**. This reduced the asset load ) Tj
T* (to literally zero additional network payload, allowing the 3D canvas to initiali) Tj
T* (ze in under 200 milliseconds while still supporting camera orbiting and box laye) Tj
T* (r explosion.) Tj
T* () Tj
/F2 9.5 Tf
T* (What Would I Do Differently Next Time?) Tj
/F1 9 Tf
T* (If building this from day one again, I would implement **IndexedDB client-side t) Tj
T* (elemetry caching** earlier in the architecture. While the live telemetry API int) Tj
T* (erpolates sensor fluctuations cleanly, having an offline-first service worker ca) Tj
T* (che would allow field officers in remote apiaries with zero GSM connectivity to ) Tj
T* (browse historical hive weight curves and queue their notes locally until cellula) Tj
T* (r signal is restored.) Tj
T* () Tj
/F2 9.5 Tf
T* (One Thing I Learned That Surprised Me) Tj
/F1 9 Tf
T* (I was surprised by how much **system prompt persona engineering influences user ) Tj
T* (engagement depth**. ) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Early iterations of the AI assistant used a single generic chatbot prompt that s) Tj
T* (ounded like a generic customer support agent. By segmenting the AI into 4 specia) Tj
